    <!--
        Phosphor Icons (https://phosphoricons.com, MIT license), the set the design in #8 uses.
        Exported from the Figma file and normalized to a 24x24 grid by tools in the design repo.
        Outline icons are stroked (Path.icon style, 1.5px at 24px); Icon.More, Icon.Paw and Icon.Play are filled (Path.icon-filled).
        Scale a Path with RenderTransform to get Phosphor's other sizes: 32px keeps a 2px stroke, 16px a 1px stroke.
